Package: com.551.watusiservicediag
Name: WatusiServiceDiag
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Diagnostic logger for WhatsApp/Watusi ServiceExtension failures. Records Jetsam memory-limit assignments, verifies the kernel's effective limits, samples ServiceExtension physical footprint, and logs common crash/exit paths. Does not change memory limits.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
